{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-maison","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"maison-elysee-2-pantheon-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"In the Pantheon project at JVC, you will find two outstanding towers - Maison Elysee 2 and Maison Elysee 3, which symbolize luxury and modern style. They fit perfectly into the picturesque JVC quarter, representing the epitome of elegance and beauty. Modern facades and the surrounding landscape create an atmosphere of comfort and harmony, inviting guests to enjoy the atmosphere of luxury.Penetrating inside the Maison Elysee, you will find yourself in a world of luxury and functionality. Spacious living rooms, exquisite kitchens and cozy bedrooms create the perfect atmosphere for living and relaxing. Every detail of the interior, be it high-quality materials or advanced technologies, is carefully selected to ensure the comfort and well-being of residents, giving the spaces an elegant look and functionality.The location of Maison Elysee in the heart of the picturesque JVC quarter makes it an attractive choice for a family lifestyle. Due to its convenient location near shopping malls, parks and entertainment venues, it becomes an attractive place for those who appreciate comfort and coziness. Maison Elysee offers a modern lifestyle surrounded by beauty and comfort, turning every moment of your stay into an unforgettable experience.","price":659900,"title":"Maison Elysee 2","bitrix":{"id":800,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Maison Elysee 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Maison Elysee 2","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Pantheon","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/870/images/2024/04/12/340x252/7UA7G6tCssr2J90qCGkskAqVofENeNn9pdZF8r4Q.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/870/images/2024/04/12/464x312/7U