iving with uninterrupted sea views and elegant architectural design.Cheval Blanc Maison is made for those who appreciate finest beachfront living. It offers peaceful surroundings along with top-tier hospitality and lifestyle features. With private beach access, open green areas, great dining options, a relaxing spa, and a private marina, the experience is both luxurious and complete. These Cheval Blanc Maison branded residences combine high-end living with strong investment potential in one of Dubai’s best locations.","price":null,"title":"Cheval Blanc Maison","bitrix":{"id":1278,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Cheval Blanc Maison","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Shamal Holding","project_location":"Naïa Island Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_8412b6fb3b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_8412b6fb3b.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":6148436.356290671,"lng":2878906.0155518283},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_3fdaba550c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_3fdaba550c.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_g_1_3d63a4fb3d.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_g_1_3d63a4fb3d.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_8412b6fb3b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_Luxury_Beachfront_Residences_8412b6fb3b.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cheval_Blanc_Maison_Dubai_L