 with a terrace, swimming pools for adults and children, recreation area, luxury spa center, gym with the most modern equipment, restaurant and cafe, children's club and playground, barbecue area, lobby, 24-hour concierge service and security service, babysitting, multi-level secure parking and much more.Downtown Burj Dubai is home to the best educational, cultural, entertainment and business facilities. Dubai Mall is a 3-minute walk from the residential tower. In addition, Suq Al Bahar, Dubai Opera House and the famous Burj Khalifa skyscraper are also nearby. Dubai city center is 2 km away. Dubai International Airport is 14 km away.","price":1650000,"title":"Damac Maison Mall Street","bitrix":{"id":403,"pf_id":"are.2.11174","source":null,"project_id":"Damac Maison Mall Street","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Damac Maison Mall Street","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Downtown Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/340x252/YkFsnmYoz12ODQg0xIwGOjV7sSMHq2kW1R9kHkmC.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/464x312/YkFsnmYoz12ODQg0xIwGOjV7sSMHq2kW1R9kHkmC.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1952442,"lng":55.2810255},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/340x252/5amRxrtER91TEkq4G5U4414ppU1qLrDJ9nsZP0la.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/464x312/5amRxrtER91TEkq4G5U4414ppU1qLrDJ9nsZP0la.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/340x252/RP33Qd9HlAZ0i1YcdOM4zyhIoIIwcggQlojM0sgz.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/464x312/RP33Qd9HlAZ0i1YcdOM4zyhIoIIwcggQlojM0sgz.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1071/images/2024/02/21/340x252/YkFsnmYo